      "pointer": "/result/data/items/0/desc_loc",
      "quote": "<h1>Active: Switch Attribute</h1>Switches between +%bonus_stat% Strength, +%bonus_stat% Agility, or +%bonus_stat% Intelligence.\nMovement speed bonuses from multiple pairs of boots do not stack.",
      "summary": "动力鞋：仅采用所引用的官方文字效果。",
