      "pointer": "/result/data/items/0/desc_loc",
      "quote": "<h1>Passive: Chain Lightning</h1>Grants a %chain_chance%%% chance on attack to release a bolt of electricity that leaps between %chain_strikes% targets within a %chain_radius% radius, dealing %chain_damage% magical damage to each. Lightning proc pierces evasion.",
      "summary": "漩涡：仅采用所引用的官方文字效果。",
      "conditions": [
        "连锁闪电依赖攻击概率触发，不等于每次攻击必定命中或清掉幻象。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "item-manta",
      "hero_id": null,
      "item_key": "manta",
      "tag": "item_effect",
      "status": "verified",
      "source_id": "item-manta",
      "pointer": "/result/data/items/0/desc_loc",
      "quote": "<h1>Active: Mirror Image</h1>Creates %images_count% images of your hero that last %illusion_duration% seconds. <br><br>Melee images deal %tooltip_damage_outgoing_melee%%% damage, while Ranged images deal %tooltip_damage_outgoing_ranged%%%. Illusions take %tooltip_damage_incoming_total_pct%%% damage. <br><br>Dispel Type: <span class=\"GameplayValues GameplayVariable\">Basic Dispel</span>",
      "summary": "幻影斧：仅采用所引用的官方文字效果。",
      "conditions": [
        "仅讨论基本驱散可处理的效果；被限制使用物品或效果不可基本驱散时不能据此自救。",
        "幻象输出与带线价值是战术假设，不代表实际存活收益。"
      ]
    },
